Hi,

I tried to process kerneldoc to sound/soc/soc-*.c and
include/sound/soc.h, and hit quite lots of warnings.  Many of them are
trivial, typos, but some are unclear.

I Cc'ed relevant people: could you guys fix these properly for 3.19
kernel?

FYI, you can get the errors, e.g.
	scripts/kernel-doc sound/soc/soc-core.c > /dev/null


thanks,

Takashi

